WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.200
[Workshop ambience; mechanical sounds]

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:16.000
[Electronic sounds and workshop ambience]

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.400
Oh, oh, oh, oh!
[Can clatters into the bucket]

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.500
Success!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.500
He did it!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.000
He did not fail!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.500
[Another can clatters into the bucket]

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.400
Nice.
